<h1>AgentRAG support</h1>
<p>Contact <strong>Mathieu MOUBRI</strong> at <a href="mailto:mathieu.moubri@gmail.com">mathieu.moubri@gmail.com</a> for help, account deletion requests or questions about your personal data.</p>
<h2>Requesting help</h2>
<p>Describe the problem, when it occurred and the email address used for your AgentRAG account. Include a redacted screenshot if helpful. Do not send passwords, OAuth tokens, API keys or confidential document contents.</p>
<h2>Signing in</h2>
<p>Use Continue with Google or your existing AgentRAG email and password. Associating Google with an existing account keeps its documents in that account. Creating a separate account starts an empty knowledge base.</p>
<h2>Your documents and account</h2>
<p>You can delete individual documents in the website. To request account deletion, contact the support address from the email associated with your account. We may need to verify your identity before acting.</p>
